{"type":"text","timestamp":1794523062880,"sessionID":"ses_e2e198e88ffeLY7qjYK4q8qPph","part":{"id":"prt_1d1e8d829002PeNDTpf5uhT10h","sessionID":"ses_e2e198e88ffeLY7qjYK4q8qPph","messageID":"msg_1d1e8c5e8001sjN2kfhK0XaHUp","type":"text","text":"T011 complete.\n\n## File written\n\n`.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`\n\n- Imports the shared `OllamaAdapter` and `getManifest` from the shared dist paths the task names.\n- New section `4. EMBEDDING MEASUREMENT`: one isolated first call, then 30 timed query embeddings through the `nomic-embed-text-v1.5` manifest, summarised as `warm.n`, `warm.medianMs`, `warm.p95Ms` with nearest-rank percentiles.\n- When `/api/ps` held no matching model before the first call, the first call is `cold.firstCallMs` and the pre-embed `ollama serve` RSS is `idle.serveRssKb`. Otherwise `cold` is `null` with `coldReason: \"model already loaded\"`.\n- CLI entry now emits `server`, `model`, `loaded`, `memory`, `idle`, `warm`, `cold`, `coldReason`. No writes, no server control, no model pull or unload.\n\n## Verify output\n\n```\n$ node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs | jq -c '.warm, .cold'\n{\"n\":30,\"medianMs\":7.97,\"p95Ms\":9.72}\nnull\n```\n\nSecond run confirmed the same shape: `{\"n\":30,\"medianMs\":4.63,\"p95Ms\":8.66}` and `cold: null` with `coldReason: \"model already loaded\"`.\n\nSame-file regression checks:\n\n```\n$ OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9 node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs\nollama server not answering at http://127.0.0.1:9\nexit=2\n```\n\n## Not done\n\n- No live `cold.firstCallMs` sample was taken: the model is currently loaded, and unloading it or stopping the server is outside this task. The cold branch is exercised when T033 waits for the natural 5-minute unload.\n- `tasks.md` was not modified and the T011 checkbox was left unticked.\n- No other file was touched. The script remains untracked (`??`), as it was before this task.","time":{"start":1794523060265,"end":1794523062880}}}
